DATA INFORMATION:

  Time identifier:          day
  Level-2 identifier:       person
  Sample Size:              2713
  Level-2 Clusters:         131
  Missing Data Info:

                      Pattern #:       1     2     3     4
                          miss % --------------------------
                    sleep =  1.3       -     -     M     M  
               sleep.lag1 =  6.1       -     M     -     M  
                                 --------------------------
                                 %  93.2   5.5   0.7   0.6


MODEL INFORMATION:

  NUMBER OF PARAMETERS
    Outcome Models:         6
    Generated Parameters:   3
    Predictor Models:       0

  FACTORS
    Level-2:                b_0j b_1j

  DEFINED VARIABLES
    [1]  sleep_lag = sleep.lag - b_0j 

  MODELS

   between:
    [1]  b_0j ~ Intercept@b_0
    [2]  b_1j ~ Intercept@b_1
    [3]  b_0j <-> b_1j

   within:
    [4]  sleep ~ b_0j@1 (sleep_lag)*b_1j@1

  GENERATED PARAMETERS
    [1]  b_1_sd = sqrt(b_1j.totalvar)
    [2]  b_1_low = b_1-b_1_sd
    [3]  b_1_high = b_1+b_1_sd


